  <Callout kind="remember">
    Audio keys on moments, so use <code>spin:reelLanding</code> for the thunk. The HUD
    keys on state, so use <code>spin:start</code> to lock the button and
    the <code>SpinResult</code> on <code>spin:complete</code> to read the outcome.
    Everything else on this page is a refinement of those two sentences.
  </Callout>
</Architecture>
